## Import

OCI providers can be imported using the provider UUID:

```sh
terraform import yba_oci_provider.example <provider-uuid>
```

An instance-principal provider plans cleanly after import. An API-key provider does not: YugabyteDB Anywhere masks the private key on read, so the key is absent from state after import and the next plan sends it again. Set `private_key_content` or `private_key_file_path` in configuration before that plan. To keep later plans empty, add the key argument to `lifecycle.ignore_changes`.
